{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>YHWH will count</b> — the meaning is that HaShem alone knows the number of all the world, in His writing, and He is able to count all who are born, who are wise in Zion, for they are many beyond human numbering." "<b>This one was born there</b> — it turns back to Zion." "And the meaning of <b>in writing</b> — HaShem and the sefarim, they themselves are the heavens."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 87, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:14.379303780Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}